Sītā places straw between herself and Rāvaṇa --- Sītā praises Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa as deadly --- Sītā says Laṅkā will be widowed through Rāvaṇa --- Sītā offers body to bonds or death unyielding --- Rāvaṇa grants twelve months then threatens cooking --- Rāvaṇa orders Rākṣasīs to break her pride --- Rāvaṇa orders Sītā guarded in Aśōkavana --- Rākṣasīs take Sītā to Aśōkavana --- Sītā recalling Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa faints with grief